<h1 local-id=3D"ff1f6d709af1" id=3D"CR213-UATScenarios-1.UATObjective"><spa=
n data-colorid=3D"iuffqtm11v">1. UAT Objective</span></h1>
<p local-id=3D"bf4cc8e524f1">To confirm that <strong>business users</strong=
> can successfully create, approve, and financially process <strong>Movies =
24</strong> and <strong>Syfy</strong> contracts such that:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"adf1f2f9-306e-4205-81c4-e3e0fa103b82">
<li local-id=3D"81e51bb0-9e4f-4dae-aeb0-ea8a3d9c1baf">
<p local-id=3D"74868e0239ea">Financial postings flow to <strong>Company Cod=
e 2000</strong></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"618947ee-f097-44f1-be72-3414f23e0698">
<p local-id=3D"23f9af563699">Correct <strong>G/L Codes</strong> are applied=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9c333615-5416-4b52-ba05-c0effc5517e9">
<p local-id=3D"bab2c23bf63c">Correct <strong>SAP Profit Centres</strong> ar=
e used in WBS creation</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"babe5cf2-cb1b-404e-9e44-872d2ac1a3f4">
<p local-id=3D"45dddc4d52b7">No manual intervention is required within Righ=
tsLogic</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"e526a150-24cc-4e15-ba68-0cf3631d4319">
<h1 local-id=3D"2b23fe169db1" id=3D"CR213-UATScenarios-2.UATEntryCriteria">=
<span data-colorid=3D"ugf8uj72q0">2. UAT Entry Criteria</span></h1>
<ul local-id=3D"138f0a5e-e434-40f5-9577-95f0c841b222">
<li local-id=3D"6cf1e6e4-0249-4980-aa65-7959eb0bcaad">
<p local-id=3D"7cba6008e094">CR213 deployed to UAT</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2b7cda59-9506-4122-aec8-29efc167dec5">
<p local-id=3D"b73485649d98">SAP changes are available in SAP test environm=
ent</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8f0416e9-2712-4ff3-8fb4-bf3c35508fc6">
<p local-id=3D"01e21fff2c39">Budget lines <strong>Movies 24</strong> and <s=
trong>Syfy</strong> enabled for use</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ad88e188-d1fd-4574-998a-0bc7f6b8f1a5">
<p local-id=3D"78c69c50ff4c">Finance team will move all existing Syfy and M=
ovies 24 WBS codes to company 2000</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a9c384bc-e380-4bb6-b5db-97090cd25168">
<p local-id=3D"5a7134f955dc">Business users have Rights=E2=80=91In and Righ=
ts=E2=80=91In=E2=80=91Finance access</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"381ef005-05d8-4756-a513-a9bc29568fe4">
<h1 local-id=3D"531d8dbb994f" id=3D"CR213-UATScenarios-3.UATScenarios"><spa=
n data-colorid=3D"ao51b1x9k1">3. UAT Scenarios</span></h1>
<h2 local-id=3D"f73622966a01" id=3D"CR213-UATScenarios-UAT=E2=80=9101:Movie=
s24-NewContractCreation(HappyPath)">UAT=E2=80=9101: Movies 24 - New Contrac=
t Creation (Happy Path)</h2>
<p local-id=3D"03e979c5955c"><strong>Business Scenario</strong><br>
As a business user, I want to create a new <strong>Movies 24</strong> contr=
act so that financials are posted under <strong>Sky UK (Company Code 2000)<=
/strong>.</p>
<p local-id=3D"9dad388c8cc2"><strong>Pre=E2=80=91conditions</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"92f674ab-f4cd-42bd-870c-8efa8d4547b9">
<li local-id=3D"05a4e655-2622-4e3b-aa55-302f6d7520f2">
<p local-id=3D"1078eb10a451">CR213 configuration deployed</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"972cd3d8-1f3f-4e85-9f81-7afac43736a7">
<p local-id=3D"fee27cd52a2c">No existing WBS linked to the contract</p></li=
>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"421e9e11d868"><strong>Steps</strong></p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"a5c26a63-3ca5-424a-8427-a5af8fbc2aaa">
<li local-id=3D"68271b01-3cae-4875-ab82-be9ecae0a08f">
<p local-id=3D"ffa8fa56f2af">Create a new Rights=E2=80=91In contract</p></l=
i>
<li local-id=3D"f2b53d96-983a-43d8-a90b-59e42e1b3407">
<p local-id=3D"9caf184e48e2">Select <strong>Movies 24</strong> budget line<=
/p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9c370114-b4a5-4cc4-8d35-51fb19b0e5ef">
<p local-id=3D"831866fdf53d">Complete commercial terms</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"febdf9fd-cc08-4946-ad8e-7b137a46e03f">
<p local-id=3D"7d97307df205">Approve the contract</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"827cf3b96a0f"><strong>Expected Results</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"6a4b98ba-d36e-4db0-867e-e6b2c53fbca3">
<li local-id=3D"58b53a91-b4e4-4935-a50f-b3c4e5c637e5">
<p local-id=3D"9df3ed55762c">Contract saves and approves successfully</p></=
li>
<li local-id=3D"415dfc0d-89c8-4c2b-a129-704d2ccfe11e">
<p local-id=3D"07b1caae341b">Budget Line =3D <strong>Movies 24</strong></p>=
</li>
<li local-id=3D"38718617-724a-4249-a61d-ef88a5b0ea46">
<p local-id=3D"05f4c5f139f8">SAP Profit Centre =3D <strong>Sky Movies</stro=
ng></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"55cf90e4-a071-49f2-a48f-15c9b705b90f">
<p local-id=3D"c04593050a30">No validation or financial errors</p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"ee287f39-0c49-4d9b-b4b5-852c90bb0f6c">
<h2 local-id=3D"c7729ded46ac" id=3D"CR213-UATScenarios-UAT=E2=80=9102:Movie=
s24-WBSCreation&amp;SAPInterface">UAT=E2=80=9102: Movies 24 - WBS Creation =
&amp; SAP Interface</h2>
<p local-id=3D"c3d558232e63"><strong>Business Scenario</strong><br>
As Finance, I need a WBS to be created in SAP under the correct company cod=
e.</p>
<p local-id=3D"a3cef9bf3bae"><strong>Steps</strong></p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"d4759ce8-d52d-4ff5-8170-0fd73639bc1a">
<li local-id=3D"bd22053c-e14f-429b-9259-6d83b69c0a3f">
<p local-id=3D"955d7fb7208c">From an approved Movies 24 contract</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4e46378c-c454-4bdf-92f3-39629c309568">
<p local-id=3D"33df575349c0">Trigger WBS instruction generation</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4b09bfdb-f310-41c7-8a5c-a7b4bf542b29">
<p local-id=3D"a4375dc3c5c6">Monitor SAP interface output</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"e1aeee65bde8"><strong>Expected Results</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"8cef836a-4eb7-4207-9b6d-dbf146545cb3">
<li local-id=3D"9ad7eb18-6111-41ab-b554-74572cddea1f">
<p local-id=3D"8a20938dbb5f">WBS instruction sent to SAP</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0efdfef1-ae6e-41aa-9597-c918fba572b6">
<p local-id=3D"bed12eef778d"><strong>Company Code =3D 2000</strong></p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"88a46844-7a9f-4208-a23b-fa4e40993dbd">
<p local-id=3D"46b563737950"><strong>Profit Centre =3D Sky Movies</strong><=
/p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5e01256d-63bb-49ce-9e55-8b3152e4d365">
<p local-id=3D"050c10116d1c">SAP accepts the instruction successfully</p></=
li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"c24c000c-57c2-4b5d-8698-e5d656855095">
<h2 local-id=3D"851b9baa4a14" id=3D"CR213-UATScenarios-UAT=E2=80=9103:Movie=
s24-AccrualPostingValidation">UAT=E2=80=9103: Movies 24 - Accrual Posting V=
alidation</h2>
<p local-id=3D"83b04a78c16a"><strong>Business Scenario</strong><br>
As Finance, I want accruals to post to the correct G/L accounts.</p>
<p local-id=3D"ada3d4a17fc0"><strong>Steps</strong></p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"13586aac-044f-4d25-880b-21d304868b86">
<li local-id=3D"84435299-21ad-4a6d-b7b5-51ebc395c3e3">
<p local-id=3D"5507987ffe7f">Run accruals for Movies 24 contract</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"150f7633-53d3-4707-bdaa-43d85d3c640b">
<p local-id=3D"84e58a8cdee8">Review generated GL postings</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"4a94d79c779a"><strong>Expected Results</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"395baaa0-3e8f-4074-867f-58ad5790e5d0">
<li local-id=3D"07c202b9-080d-4842-8b73-4a6804bbfbfb">
<p local-id=3D"6a96518cb41b">Assets Dr =E2=86=92 <code>2000.15120.MOVI9</co=
de></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6cd227d3-7d75-4810-acdb-b87adadc1350">
<p local-id=3D"26023c2175f9">Liabilities Cr =E2=86=92 <code>2000.21520.MOVI=
9</code></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3d11949b-6765-4e8b-a33c-9bdcaa070b33">
<p local-id=3D"0be9fb23d44a">Posting succeeds without errors</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a29ef742-65b3-4e74-a4bb-0b0ca2e533f5">
<p local-id=3D"d768de708275">Posting associated with Company Code <strong>2=
000</strong></p></li>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"6018a508-cf26-47f8-a187-0620c5f8a255">
<h2 local-id=3D"4bd6c100b084" id=3D"CR213-UATScenarios-UAT=E2=80=9104:Movie=
s24-AmortisationPostingValidation">UAT=E2=80=9104: Movies 24 - Amortisation=
 Posting Validation</h2>
<p local-id=3D"c96eaebe755a"><strong>Business Scenario</strong><br>
As Finance, I want amortisation postings to use correct Sky Movies GL codes=
.</p>
<p local-id=3D"2be7d6f4b163"><strong>Steps</strong></p>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"4e1b4f88-1e31-4a82-a0b7-0a28a65e5bd6">
<li local-id=3D"7a11ef54-2155-4741-8028-5ea0c3b344e8">
<p local-id=3D"22311ecf7968">Run amortisation for Movies 24 title</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bb1aa3ed-ac04-41ec-8eed-bb8dc454f080">
<p local-id=3D"1cd7a5f0d80d">Review GL postings</p></li>
</ol>
<p local-id=3D"c2c8ff452483"><strong>Expected Results</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"93878a33-7b07-499d-a3ed-cb94b00ff107">
<li local-id=3D"50b60116-ba76-4900-8174-920b94a9bd8b">
<p local-id=3D"20fa9d87f02e">Amortisation Dr =E2=86=92 <code>225011.40010.G=
BPBS</code></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"5740b21c-6a65-42ca-a557-2ddc616dd07f">
<p local-id=3D"a46130703840">Amortisation Cr =E2=86=92 <code>2000.15130.MOV=
I9</code></p></li>
<li local-id=3D"218c8c16-8ebb-4dcb-908b-2692b014ad67">
<p local-id=3D"f8f69db08ade">No posting failures</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a9ae7a7f-6ab1-4ce2-96e3-174dfc2d1d23">
<p local-id=3D"32fc835f0f89">Company Code <strong>2000</strong> used</p></l=
i>
</ul>
<hr local-id=3D"9c3300e1-df24-4855-a9d0-55860bae7b3d">
<h2 local-id=3D"dc10d783a151" id=3D"CR213-UATScenarios-UAT=E2=80=9105:Syfy-=
NewContractCreation">UAT=E2=80=9105: Syfy - New Contract Creation</h2>
<p local-id=3D"1fb954a9ed59"><strong>Business Scenario</strong><br>
As a business user, I want to create a new <strong>Syfy</strong> contract u=
